Package: ChainBinomial
Title: Chain Binomial Models for Infectious Disease Transmission
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Yang", "Yang", email = "yang.yang4@uga.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulation and maximum likelihood estimation for chain binomial
    models of infectious disease transmission in household and community
    studies. Supports time-independent and time-dependent covariates,
    multiple incubation and infectious period distributions, and
    case-ascertained study designs.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
